            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "ui2 doenst throw a stack trace on a deprecated feature warning. \nVerified with the latest version: `v0.13.0-dev-1376+g6423657352`\n\n```lua\nrequire(\"vim._core.ui2\").enable({})\n\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('TextYankPost', {\n    callback = function()\n        vim.hl.on_yank() -- deprecated\n        -- vim.hl.hl_op() -- new\n    end,\n})\n```\n\nThere is no bug. The reason of this message/issue must be in your config/plugins.\n",
