            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Ran into this error myself today when doing a `:packupdate`. Was able to reduce it to a repro:\n\n```lua\nrequire(\"vim._core.ui2\").enable {}\nvim.api.nvim_echo({ { \"hi\" } }, true)\nvim.api.nvim_feedkeys(\"g<\", \"n\", false)\nvim.defer_fn(function()\n  vim.api.nvim_echo({ { (\"e\"):rep(9999), \"WarningMsg\" } }, true)\n  vim.defer_fn(function()\n    vim.api.nvim_feedkeys(\"g<\", \"n\", false) -- expands full emsg\n  end, 500)\nend, 500)\n```",
            "created_at": "2026-08-22T11:02:37Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/41419#issuecomment-5379882457",
